WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.178 --> 00:00:03.950
A customer asks a question and nobody answers:

00:00:04.139 --> 00:00:05.310
that's a lost customer.

00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:09.844
The VaraaAi inbox brings all your customers' messages into one place,

00:00:09.794 --> 00:00:11.310
with ready-made replies,

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.190
and an AI assistant that covers for you when you're busy.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.873
Tap Messages.

00:00:16.197 --> 00:00:19.500
At the top are the number of conversations, unread messages,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.073
and messages waiting for you.

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:25.313
Below is the list of customers, which you can filter by Unread or Waiting.

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:27.633
Tap a customer to open the conversation.

00:00:28.241 --> 00:00:31.893
Type your answer in the box, Type a message, and tap send.

00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:37.458
To go faster, use the quick replies right below, such as Welcome, How to book,

00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:38.293
or Available.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.213
You can add your own replies too.

00:00:40.816 --> 00:00:42.542
Scroll down to Message settings.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:46.668
When you turn on the AI assistant, it replies to customers automatically,

00:00:46.618 --> 00:00:48.462
using your services and products,

00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:49.342
while you're away.

00:00:49.771 --> 00:00:52.542
Customers can still tap Talk to the owner at any time.

00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:56.371
It's also a good idea to tap Enable notifications on this device,

00:00:56.321 --> 00:00:57.822
so you never miss a message.

00:00:58.171 --> 00:00:59.422
Now take the quiz below.
